      "kind": "nav",
      "description": "Four visible teacher destinations with a lower selection rule.",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"Main navigation\"><button class=\"ds-nav-selected\" aria-current=\"page\">Quizzes</button><button>Grades</button><button>Leaderboard</button><button>Funny answers</button></nav>",
